    "detailed_description": "A long, long time ago.<br />\r\nCountless nations have been born and died on the continent of Shizaka.<br />\r\nYou will explore the stories of nations, soldiers, and residents in this unknown land,<br />\r\ninvestigate and discover why these stories were told, and uncover the secrets of the Shizaka Continent, one by one.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA great war is brewing in the world of Shizaka.<br />\r\nChoose your nation and troops and go head-to-head with your enemies.<br />\r\nCountless strategies and tactics require constant thinking.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;Strategy is Eternal, Victory is in an Instant.&quot;<br />\r\nNONAME is a simple yet complex strategy board game.<br />\r\nYou place nine pieces on an 8X8 game board, and you win by capturing the most territory.<br />\r\nBut you can't just place your pieces.<br />\r\nYou'll need to place your pieces according to an organized tactical sequence.<br />\r\nEnjoy multiplayer with tactics and strategy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnique troops: As of Early Access, there are 24 troops and 216 horses.<br />\r\n                         Each one of them has different stats, allowing for creative and unique strategies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSet your tactics: Set the order of your 9 different pieces. With good tactics, you can easily beat your opponents.<br />\r\n                           There are 362,880 tactics in a single troop.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTactics sharing system: NONAME allows users to share their tactics in multi-window.<br />\r\n                                      Tactics used in real-time battles are posted in the online window.<br />\r\n                                      When you use a tactic, your wins and losses are recorded in the tactic information.<br />\r\n                                      Check out good tactics and take them home.<br />\r\n                                      And find the best ones!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNew tactics and strategies: You can create your own tactics and name them.<br />\r\n                                            Then use them to discover new strategies in matches!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nColorful Grade: Earn colorful ratings from 1-9.<br />\r\n                         The higher your rating score, the higher your rating.<br />\r\n                         And become the best player on the server.<br />\r\n                         Rankings 1-13 will have hidden ratings.<br />\r\n              <br />\r\nWar Situation and Logical Thinking: This game requires logical thinking and wordplay.<br />\r\n                                                          Arrange your pieces in a logical manner and control the flow of the battle with war situation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNoname :  https://discatgames.imweb.me/",
